{"articleNo":"146776","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=146776&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대구통학버스] 2016년 정기권 및 3월권 추가 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.02.29","hit":"3577","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>2016학년도 1학기 정기권 및 3월 월권 대구통학버스 <font color=\"#0055ff\">추가 신청 일정을 </font>안내하오니 기간 내 신청(납부)하여 주시기 바랍니다. </strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&nbsp;1. 신청(납부)기간 : 2016. 2. 29.(월) ~ 3. 3.(목)</strong></span> </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><strong></strong>&nbsp;<font size=\"3\"> </font><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&nbsp;2. 납부계좌 : 계좌입금</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 농협 301-0186-6523-81 (예금주: 금오공과대학교)</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#0055ff\">입금후 전화를 해주셔야 통학버스를 이용할 수 있음</font></span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;3. 입금시 :&nbsp;학생이름과 학번&nbsp;기재 바람.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">